id.instance: String (TS "c<n>")
num.game: i32
num.cursor: u32
map.ordered: IndexMap
bag.data: IndexMap<String, serde_json::Value>
error.style: Result<_, EngineError> with TS's message; panic only on invariants (answer_prompt's TS `string | null` read as Result<(), EngineError>)
null.optional: Option + skip_serializing_if
null.nullable: Option, serialised null
case.json: camelCase via serde rename_all
case.rust: snake_case
state.mut: &mut GameState writes, &GameState reads, &mut EngineSink for TS sink mutators
rng.source: Rng::new(&state.seed, state.rng_cursor) and write the cursor back (TS sinkFor's scratch sink does not write it back, nor does its port)
hook.style: Arc<dyn Fn + Send + Sync> via hook(); no fn pointers, no Box
registry.style: OnceLock set once by register_all; fused scripts built on lookup from state (tests use the testkit's thread-local register_scripts, and registered_scripts() must return that override once set)
async.style: tokio in crates/server only; none in pure crates
log.style: tracing JSON to stdout, server only
